WEBVTT

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.160
Work's done!

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.340
Phew, finally finished...

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.160
Hey, today's your last day, huh?

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.180
Good work.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.830
Oh, Boss.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.350
H-hey, you okay?

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.120
Y-yeah...

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.890
I have to make up for the amount I lost at the last job...

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.600
Hahaha...

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.230
I see...well, you can come back whenever you need to.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.720
Good work.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.310
Th-thank you very much.

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:33.640
Phew...

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.940
now that I earned some money,

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.860
I guess I can buy Haruka's present.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:40.970
Hm?

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:47.620
Yuuto-san.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.230
How do I look?

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:52.510
Haruka...

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:53.850
Hm

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:54.810
Oh,

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:56.380
this...

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:33.000
(The Ayase's & The Nogizaka's Christmas Party Hall)

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.320
Everyone~, are you ready?

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:39.470
Well then, let's begin the Nogizaka and the Ayase's combined Christmas Party.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.220
("Yuuto-san's Scent...")

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.390
Merry Christmas!!

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.700
Merry Christmas!

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.720
Here, here, please don't hesitate to help yourself~

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:49.670
It's time to splurge.

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:51.220
koku koku

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:52.440
Here!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.620
Yu-Yuuto-san, I'll prepare your plate.

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:58.710
Well, well.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:02:59.530
Hmph,

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.700
why do I have to be here?

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:04.920
Oh, why not?

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:08.230
Don't be so grumpy on Christmas eve...okay?

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:08.780
uh...

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.050
Yuuto-san.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:16.490
Uh...

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.170
Um, here you go.

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:20.220
O-oh, thanks.

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.270
Mm, good.

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:27.290
Hm? Is there something on my face?

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.240
Oh...

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:31.160
no, it's nothing like that...

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:32.450
It's just...

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:33.300
Hm?

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.440
I really like this kind of party.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:42.250
I've been to public parties and formal receptions,

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:47.200
but I've never had a Christmas party like this with everyone.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.680
So, I'm really having fun.

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:51.020
I see...

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.550
then, you gotta make the most of it, right?

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:54.540
Yes!

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.530
You guys are in your own world again~

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.140
Huh?

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:07.120
Geez, it's not fair that onee-chan gets your sole attention~

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:08.570
Yay!

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:09.990
H-hey.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:10.960
Mi-Mika.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:17.630
No-Nogizaka's second daughter shouldn't be acting so shamelessly in public...

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.760
B-besides, if you want to sit on a lap, it doesn't have to be this guy, since I'm here!

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:27.470
What~, no~, Dad's looks too rough and tough and uncomfortable.

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.350
I want to sit on onii-san's!

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:30.520
What!

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:32.530
Mi-Mika...

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:37.700
Damn you, Ayase Yuuto! It's all your fault...!

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.200
Ehehe~

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:42.350
Gorogoronya~

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:43.790
Uh, um...

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:52.390
(Christmas Drinking Competition)

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:52.660
Hmph, what a daring party.

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:58.460
We can never be defeated by alcohol.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:03.950
I like to be massaged, but I don't want to be defeated~!

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:06.830
I've told Yuuto that we won't be back till morning.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.160
We have nothing to hold us back.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:10.280
Come, Yukari!

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:11.100
Alright.

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:13.410
Open!

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.750
Today's main event~

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:26.060
Mika-chan Santa and Haruka-chan Santa~!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:26.880
Ooh.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:28.010
argh...

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.720
We have reindeer too!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.110
koku koku

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:32.270
Rawr!

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:33.810
Uh, um...

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.380
Sa-San...

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.220
Oh, geez...

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:39.030
Here!

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:39.350
Ah!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:42.410
Um...

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:45.840
I'm Santa Clause-san...

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:47.840
Um...

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.390
Meri-Chri...desu.

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:52.780
Blarg!

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:54.240
Uh, um...

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.450
l-looks good.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:58.900
R-really?

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:00.980
Thank you very much!

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:05.790
When I hear that from Yuuto-san... I just...

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:07.990
Uh

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:08.010
Oh

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:12.710
Geez, in your own world again...

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:13.760
Oh!

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:13.740
Ah!

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:15.450
mmm...

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:17.950
Y-you guys,

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.360
wh-wh-wh-what are you wearing!?

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:27.910
Y-you better not start wrapping ribbons around your chest, saying, "The present is... me"!!

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:31.510
Y-you can't! Do anything so immoral!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.420
mmm...that's too bad.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:38.530
Wh-what!?!?

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:41.310
Gosh, that's so annoying.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:43.220
Dad's no fun. I hate him.

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.170
H-hate me!?

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:46.410
Yeah.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:48.430
It's our Christmas party, but you just keep complaining.

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:50.050
Right, Onee-chan?

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:50.940
Huh?

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.010
Uh...um...

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.200
Um...

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:57.840
I wouldn't exactly say that I hate you,

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:01.180
but it'd be nice if you'd loosen up a little more...

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:04.350
Oh! Ha-Haruka too...!?

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:07.020
I love Dad.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:08.870
Mika loves him too.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:14.070
My daughters who loved me so much as children...both...

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:10.720
Hahaha

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:18.880
This is all that worthless mite's fault...

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:20.370
That's it...

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:23.870
I'll take you down, Ayase Yuuto!

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.310
Here I go!

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:25.560
Huh!?

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.980
Die in peace!!

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.010
Alice-chan.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.140
Woot.

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:34.250
Oh...argh.

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:38.460
Alice-chan, good job.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:44.680
Well then, we'll go ahead and excuse ourselves now.

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:47.980
Sorry about the cramped space.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:51.150
No, no. I had a lot of fun.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:52.630
Besides...

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:56.160
Above all else, they looked very happy, so.

00:07:57.010 --> 00:08:00.820
Yuuto-san, please take care of them from now on too.

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:01.310
Huh?

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:05.010
They really seem to like you very much...

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:10.410
So, will you be with them as much as possible?

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:12.130
Yes,

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:13.510
I got it.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.320
Thank you, Yuuto-san...

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:17.480
Oh, yes, yes!

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.280
Huh?

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:22.230
Of course, I like Yuuto-san very much, too.

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:35.990
~Daisekkin, kyuusekkin de icha icha, hanya hanya!~

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:35.990
~big approach, sudden approach, and flirty flirty, hanya hanya!~

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.340
~Touzen deshou,

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.340
~why not

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:41.790
...yay!~

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:41.790
...yay!~

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:43.170
Everyone's got so much energy.

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:47.700
I'm sorry, it's Yuuto-san's house and we're being so loud.

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:50.310
Nah, it's all good.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.310
Besides, I'm glad it's lively.

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:55.230
Really? If you say so...

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.110
Uh, um!

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:01.400
Mm.. Hm?

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.310
Uh, um...

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:06.610
could I have some time with you after this?

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:12.470
Um, I kind of have something I want to tell you in private...or there's kind of something I want to give you...

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.380
Oh, no problem.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:15.810
Really?

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:17.980
Then, after a little bit?

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:19.200
Yes!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:27.540
~Himitsu himitsu, datte himitsu.

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:27.540
~secret secret, it's a secret.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:30.650
Hontouwa motto,

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:30.650
Actually really,

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.880
ah, motto

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.880
ah, really,

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:38.120
chikazukanakucha misplay~

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:38.120
if we don't get closer, it's a misplay~

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:37.210
This is pretty nice...

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:37.670
uh!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:38.360
oh...

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:44.910
Yuuto-san!

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:46.200
I'll help you...

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.170
oh!

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:51.810
Yu-Yuuto-san!!

00:09:51.850 --> 00:09:52.770
Oh.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.600
S-someone! Someone, help!

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:52.860
Uh.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:55.810
Yuuto-san is...!!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.440
Yuuto-san is...!

00:10:00.690 --> 00:10:02.000
Oh, Yuuto-san!

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:04.340
Haruka...?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.430
I'm so relieved...

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:06.940
Yuuto-san's okay.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.960
Geez, such a hassle!

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:15.900
You wouldn't wake up whether we shook you or tickled you.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:18.530
It was so much work to carry you up here.

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:19.680
I see...

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.100
sorry.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:22.050
Hehehe.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.480
Mika-sama's saying that now,

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.880
but before, she was a wreck.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:31.320
...like, "Onii-san's dead~! Noo~ Come back~!"

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:32.740
crying all over the place.

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:34.230
Na-Nanami-san!

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:35.970
Th-that's a lie!

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:38.350
I-I never cried at all!

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:39.660
She's a grumpy grump.

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:40.530
koku koku

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:41.680
Th-that's not true!

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.030
Huh? ...who are you?

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:52.340
I'm the Nogizaka Maid Team No. 5, medic, Yukinohara Maria.

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:54.660
H-hello.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.510
Looks like it's from overworking.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:56.970
Huh?

00:10:57.680 --> 00:11:00.440
You've overworked yourself. For now, I gave you a shot of vitamins.

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:05.220
I recommend that you stay in bed for today, just in case.

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:06.980
Overworking?

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.850
What did you do, onii-san?

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:09.670
Uh,

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:11.920
well, um...

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:15.300
I might have worked too hard at work.

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:19.390
Bummer, but I guess the party's over.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:20.680
It's too bad.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.790
Should one of us stay to take care of you?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.660
I'll be okay by myself.

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:27.230
N-no.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:28.230
Haruka..?

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:30.190
O-onee-chan...

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:33.430
You can't underestimate overworking!

00:11:33.780 --> 00:11:35.330
Even the Lacrosse Club said that overworking is the cause for all sicknesses!

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:38.680
If Yuuto-san faints again,

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:40.070
I...

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:41.240
I...

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:43.490
Oh! Uh...

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:44.800
nyu...!

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:47.630
...b-but I'm worried...

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:52.210
leaving Yuuto-san home alone while he's sick...

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:54.460
So, I'm not going home!

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:56.810
I'll stay and take care of Yuuto-san!

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:57.800
What...!?

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:59.160
Hahaha

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:06.500
Merry Christmas!

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:11.190
Meri-Chri...desu!

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.170
Merry Christmas!

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.750
We're the cute on-call Santa~

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:21.050
We're here with presents!

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.750
Came here all excited, but...

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.400
Volunteer work...

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:32.360
Santa-san, give us mercy...

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:36.360
Now, now, stop complaining and give out the presents!

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.010
There!

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:39.160
Yaye!

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:40.310
Yeah!

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:41.740
Kyaah!

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:42.780
Aah!

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:43.700
Stop!

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.990
Thank you Santa-san!!

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:51.270
mm...

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:51.900
hm...

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:56.970
oh! I'm sorry,

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.310
did I wake you up?

00:12:58.970 --> 00:12:59.530
Huh!

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:00.950
Uh...nah...

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.240
Please let me know if you need anything, okay?

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.560
Oh, your face is a little red.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.350
Do you have a fever?

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:11.420
Uh, no, this is...

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:13.030
I'll check your temperature.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.430
Yeek!

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:16.960
Ha-Haruka...

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:17.860
what are you...?

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:22.770
It says here that I should check the temperature from the forehead when checking for men...

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.490
(Mika-chan Presents - Nursing Guideline)

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:26.850
Mika...

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.970
Well that's what it says, so excuse me...

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:30.800
Huh...?

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:41.210
It feels like you're temperature is getting higher...

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:43.270
In this case...

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:45.580
Stay calm...stay calm...

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:49.010
Ha-Haruka?

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.770
According to the Nursing Guideline,

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:54.900
to lower the temperature, it's best to use direct body heat to warm up and sweat it out...

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:55.780
Yeek!

00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:56.880
Okay...

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:04.740
Oh...Yuuto-san's scent...

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:05.080
Huh?

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.220
What is this...? Smells really nice...

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:09.930
it reminds me of something and calms me down...

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:13.830
Ha-Haruka...

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:15.650
Teehehe...

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:17.690
It's energy charge...

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.150
Haruka!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:21.920
Uh...

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:23.310
Hehe...

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:25.380
you're hungry, right?

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:26.940
Okay,

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.650
I'll make you something.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.600
Wahahaha!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.880
Rum, flavored vodka, tequila, anything! Bring them all!

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:40.180
Mm..pwah!

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:42.770
Aww...I'm getting hot~

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:46.500
Sensei's gonna take it off~

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:51.320
Oh, I'm getting hot too~!

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:54.620
It's hot, so please be careful.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:56.160
Huu,

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:57.320
huu.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:59.170
Here, ahhhh...

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:01.370
Uh...ahhh...

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:05.380
H-how is it?

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:07.410
Y-yeah, it's really good.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:11.300
Really! I'm glad. Please eat up!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:16.350
Great meal.

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:18.100
My pleasure.

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:19.730
I'll clean up now.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:21.360
Ah!

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:22.620
Haruka!

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:24.650
Wah!

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:25.540
Ah!

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:36.820
Uh, um...

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:38.700
Uh, no...

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:39.600
this isn't...

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:57.520
Waah!!

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:58.760
W-who is it!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.460
Oh, onii-san?

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:04.090
I forgot to tell you, but just because you guys are alone, don't do anything weird to onee-chan.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:07.140
Oh, were you in the middle of it, maybe?

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:10.390
Damn it, Ayase Yuuto!

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:12.150
It's over now!

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:12.970
Gah!

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:16.770
Ehe Ugugugugugugu

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:20.660
Uhuhu...please at least trust them a little bit.

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:22.250
Phew...

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:24.610
Now, please take good care of yourself.

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.180
Uh, yeah...

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:27.720
but I'm sorry.

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:28.330
Huh?

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:31.290
It was your first Christmas party,

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:32.830
but I ruined it...

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:34.370
That's not true...

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:36.580
I'm okay now,

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:41.320
so why don't you get Mika and them and have a party-do-over?

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:42.450
Yuuto-san...

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:47.650
I can't accept that suggestion.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:50.380
I appreciate your thoughtfulness,

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:53.010
but I think that's a little wrong.

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:53.840
Huh...?

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:57.740
Yuuto-san, until when did you believe in Santa-san?

00:16:58.030 --> 00:16:58.420
What?

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:01.910
Probably till kindergarten, maybe?

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:05.320
I believed in it until I was in 6th grade...

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.820
On Christmas, Santa-san will come...

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:11.510
So I looked forward to it every year.

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:12.550
But...

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:15.190
(Help me! They're gonna eat me!)

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:16.600
One time, I wanted to see Santa, so I set a trap.

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:20.340
However...

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.740
Santa Clause was not real.

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:24.810
Merry Christmas.

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:33.050
But...I realized right away that Hazuki-san in disguise was still a real Santa-san to me.

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:36.750
It's not Christmas because there's Santa Clause.

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:39.000
For me,

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:43.220
Hazuki-san coming to give me a present was more of a Christmas than anything else.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:45.700
It's the same as that.

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:51.790
For me, this year's Christmas is the time I spent with Yuuto-san, the time itself...

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:53.700
that's my Christmas.

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:57.540
So, please don't tell me to leave you.

00:17:58.030 --> 00:17:59.760
Please don't say anything like that!

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:10.970
You're right...

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:12.200
sorry...

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.970
I-I didn't mean it like that.

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:19.020
Besides...Christmas isn't over yet.

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:19.650
What?

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:22.260
I have a little idea.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:24.250
Can you wait for a little bit?

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.570
What are you gonna do?

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:28.650
That's...

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.170
a secret.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:31.720
(jingle bell~)

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:48.910
Haruka...what is she gonna do?

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:49.980
W-wait!!

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:52.230
Uh, um...

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:54.300
the present is...

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.500
me...

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:00.510
Thank you for waiting.

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:08.470
Oh... uh?

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:10.020
Please, come over here.

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:12.790
Haruka?

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:15.080
Hehe...here we go.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:16.880
Merry Christmas!

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:19.510
Oh!

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:24.780
Haruka, did you do this?

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:26.260
Y-yes,

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:30.540
I wanted you to enjoy the Christmas feeling at least from your room.

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:32.750
Did I do a good job?

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:35.020
Yeah. Thanks.

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:40.890
Uh, um, Yuuto-san...

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.350
this um...

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:44.880
is my Christmas present.

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:46.550
Thank you...

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.270
can I open it?

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.940
Y-yes, please!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:52.150
Wow!

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:56.060
I've never gotten a present for a man, so... I hope you like it.

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:58.300
Of course I like it!

00:19:58.710 --> 00:19:59.580
Thank you.

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:00.760
I'll treasure it.

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.760
Oh...y-yes!

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:04.610
Uh, um...

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:06.620
It's not like a thank-you gift,

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:07.920
but this is from me...

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:08.960
Oh...

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:14.220
Open it.

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:16.030
O-okay.

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:24.250
Wow...

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:25.940
Clair de Lune...

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:28.310
Moonlight, right?

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:31.760
Thank you very much! I'll treasure it!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:34.020
Oh, um...

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:36.410
can I try it on?

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:37.690
Ahh, of course.

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:41.250
Oh, then...um...

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:46.490
if it's possible, I'd like Yuuto-san to put it on...

00:20:46.630 --> 00:20:46.980
Huh?

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:48.420
Ah, wah...I...

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:49.710
What am I saying?

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:51.560
S-sorry.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:52.780
Nah, don't worry.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:53.490
Oh...

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:08.350
Merry Christmas...

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:09.960
my princess.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:20.770
Yes!

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:22.520
Merry Christmas.

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:35.270
Wow...it's snowing.

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:36.230
Uh huh.

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:37.560
So beautiful...

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.740
it's like a gift from the sky...

00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:40.880
Yeah.

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:43.590
Christmas tree, snow,

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:45.680
and innumerable stars in the sky...

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:46.970
can't beat that.

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:47.750
Yes!

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:49.800
Hm? Innumerable stars and snow...?

00:21:50.550 --> 00:21:50.970
Oh.

00:21:52.270 --> 00:21:53.120
Yuuto-san,

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:56.980
I will never forget this Christmas...

00:21:58.300 --> 00:22:00.600
the Christmas I spent with everyone...

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:04.600
and the Christmas I spent gazing at the snow with Yuuto-san...

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:05.940
Haruka...

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:07.630
Can we stay like this...

00:22:08.270 --> 00:22:09.820
just a little longer?

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:11.040
...yeah...

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:18.590
Oh...

00:22:19.530 --> 00:22:20.620
mm...

00:24:14.850 --> 00:24:18.270
(Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals)

00:24:16.380 --> 00:24:18.190
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals:

00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:29.110
(maid)

00:24:18.360 --> 00:24:22.450
a maid is someone who, in place of their masters, works around the house.

00:24:22.490 --> 00:24:23.090
koku

00:24:23.120 --> 00:24:28.180
As maids, we do everything we can to insure the best for our masters.

00:24:28.280 --> 00:24:29.090
koku koku

00:24:29.100 --> 00:24:34.990
(Next: "...Oh Yes...")

00:24:29.290 --> 00:24:30.380
By the way, Alice-chan...

00:24:30.480 --> 00:24:30.880
Huh?

00:24:31.090 --> 00:24:33.640
Is it fair that our pay is the same for this?

00:24:33.820 --> 00:24:34.560
Giku!

00:24:35.030 --> 00:24:40.070
(See you next week)

00:24:35.030 --> 00:24:40.070
(Nogizaka Haruka no Himitsu Purezza)
